# A top-level map call forks the entry pipeline per element of its split
# input; its outs are an array of the pipeline's outs, one per fork.
# TestMrpDiffSplitEntryOverride launches it with x in Martian's split form,
# an array of another length and a map, against mrp running
# override_array.mro and override_map.mro, whose literals are those values.
@include "doubler.mro"

map call DOUBLER(
    x = split [
        1,
        2,
        3,
    ],
)
